id: free-flowing
name: Free Flowing
kind: crafting
# The Metamoran Clothing's own (the Fusion Methods & Modifiers page): never crafted, it comes with that piece of Apparel, made as a
# Fusion is fused by Metamorese or Maxi Fusion (fusion-make.mjs).
special: true
slots: 1
source: Fusion Methods & Modifiers
description: >
  Strike and Wound Rolls higher by the Apparel Bonus.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Increase your Strike and Wound Rolls by the Apparel Bonus. This piece of Apparel cannot be destroyed nor replaced through the effects of Battle Uniform (apply the Qualities – except Combat Ready – from that Battle Uniform to this piece of Apparel while you are in that Transformation).
text: >
  Free Flowing: These clothes flow around your form like a cloud, allowing you to move effortlessly.
  –Effects: Increase your Strike and Wound Rolls by the Apparel Bonus. This piece of Apparel cannot be destroyed nor replaced through the effects of Battle Uniform (apply the Qualities – except Combat Ready – from that Battle Uniform to this piece of Apparel while you are in that Transformation).

---

# Its Apparel Bonus, on both.
[passive]
strike += $apparelBonus(bT);
wound += $apparelBonus(bT);
# Not destroyed nor replaced by a Battle Uniform, and its Qualities taken on: waits on the Transformations - Battle Uniform is an
# Aspect of theirs, not built yet.
